{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_synopsis", "source_sha256": "84c87ad833dc4daeea45ddf49f47f031afad37f776ad8af9ba53f921734a983f", "ja": "千早との舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "千早的后台一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_1000_se", "source_sha256": "edafcbce993c2062ba9b981b54f22be1911fe9b2fb88e83c12c1022ee66cede5", "ja": "ワァァァァァ……！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2a2787ea42c897048e96029b6d9967dc702d4c084779d34b3ec9aa31e375d505", "ja": "千早、あと少しで出番だけど……。", "zh": "千早，再过一会儿就要上场了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "db179798f3205e3aa1b5050c2506f6bf8cbcb943cdc6702615d0e976a82f4fed", "ja": "すごい……会場の音が、ここまで響いて……。", "zh": "好厉害……会场的声音竟然能传到这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7b6e1188cd0662cc66a1159e973009b29535d4ef2a41d00f43de1b885370f467", "ja": "ああ、今回の会場は最新の設備が揃っていて、\n音響もいいから。細かな音までクリアだな。", "zh": "啊，这次的会场配备了最新的设备，音响效果也很好，连细微的声音都能清晰听见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "b366f287474341135064c5512db88229fde43126e0cbd7b4a2f8d20fa83db3d7", "ja": "はい。リハーサルの時から、感動してしまって。", "zh": "是的，从彩排时开始，我就已经感动不已了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "efc702e9f1b7efc8e680acc37c7647c734f86e67aa9b94aaa3cc94b092bb90f2", "ja": "もう少しで、私の番……。\nなんだか待ち遠しいです。", "zh": "马上就要轮到我了……\n总觉得有些迫不及待呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0f61e8398ec8028948118c4cfee61b1a9cf54f9df469bec5ecc4a9eb26c2ae42", "ja": "立派な会場でライブができるのも、活動の成果だよ。\nご褒美だと思って、思いきり楽しむといい。", "zh": "能在这么气派的会场举办演唱会，也是活动成果的体现啊。\n就当作奖励，好好享受吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "6810ddf4a411c9960e4ac150bd55d1fa9c6195f1ce5f1716ca2338aae69643c3", "ja": "もう楽しんでいます。みんなの歌声も、\nひとつひとつの音が伸びやかで、輝いていて……。", "zh": "我已经在享受了。大家的歌声也是，每一个音都舒展而明亮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "4fb2a9d55d54a74075c7acd62ea72a6e38b669b908564880fd6413c523ae9957", "ja": "あ……、でも。", "zh": "啊……不过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7c59608752f267d6180b140d18e7d63d6eab88ec8f53b1bf3132cb2afda45b46", "ja": "うん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "398fb99bb821c255c0e1469c3abf449ca6f3b99bd1bb53dfa81cb09ec07c2a0c", "ja": "活動のご褒美をもらうべきなのは、私達ではなく。\n私達を、このステージに立たせてくれた人、ですね。", "zh": "应该获得活动奖励的，不是我们。\n而是让我们站上这个舞台的人，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "19653cc2fc6da38995fe8b37141db022aa819c8c855f9deb7e3e9b7c8fd281e5", "ja": "ここまでたどり着けたのも、そんな……\nずっと私達を応援してくれた人のおかげですから。", "zh": "能够一路走到这里，也是因为……一直以来为我们加油的那个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "29a3f4ff9b8ffb4815846a8bee9013cb45b1cd519fb888e8106aaa73de19c608", "ja": "ですから、ちゃんとご褒美だと思ってもらえるように。\n今日は最高の歌を、しっかり届けてきます。", "zh": "所以，我会让他们真切地感受到这是一份奖励。今天，我会把最棒的歌好好传达给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_1013_p", "source_sha256": "650fb81aa3d8c9caef474fbaa114b518fb0d654811f3e68ef7a7daa410c0dc5d", "ja": "……わかった。きっとお客さん達も、最高の舞台での\n千早の歌を楽しみにしてるだろうしな。", "zh": "……我明白了。想必观众们也都期待着在最棒的舞台上听到千早的歌吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_1014_p", "source_sha256": "770775edf1d55760a6704854871e9102070819b527bedcd8f15546188f49f849", "ja": "俺も楽しみにしてるよ。期待通りの最高の歌と、\nそれを最高に楽しんでる、千早の輝きを！", "zh": "我也很期待。期待着你唱出不负期待的最棒歌声，  \n以及尽情享受其中、闪耀着光芒的千早！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_002chi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_002chi_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "0313a86c4dd87452e1d458a68042b61732e0930fead71e2ae6b1d15cef633190", "ja": "わかりました。では、お言葉に甘えて。\n必ず、楽しんできます！", "zh": "明白了。那么，我就恭敬不如从命了。\n我一定会好好享受的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
